<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2 ext-discussiontools-init-section"><h2 id="Things_to_do" data-mw-thread-id="h-Things_to_do"><span data-mw-comment-start="" id="h-Things_to_do"></span>Things to do<span data-mw-comment-end="h-Things_to_do"></span></h2><!--__DTELLIPSISBUTTON__{"threadItem":{"headingLevel":2,"name":"h-","type":"heading","level":0,"id":"h-Things_to_do","replies":[]}}--></div>
<p><a href="/wiki/Wiktionary:Things_to_do" class="mw-redirect" title="Wiktionary:Things to do">Wiktionary:Things to do</a>:
</p>
<ul><li><a href="/wiki/Wiktionary:Todo" title="Wiktionary:Todo">Todo</a>&#160;– coverall list</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Wiktionary:Todo/Lists" title="Wiktionary:Todo/Lists">Todo lists</a>&#160;– regularly refreshed lists of pages that need fixing</li>
<li><a href="/wiki/Wiktionary:Requests_for_cleanup" title="Wiktionary:Requests for cleanup">Requests for cleanup</a> <a href="/wiki/Category:Requests_for_cleanup" title="Category:Requests for cleanup">(Automated list)</a>.<br /></li>
